<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n51063" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰσοκρᾰτ-ής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of equal power, possessing
				equal rights with others</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰσοκρατέες . . αἱ γυναῖκες τοῖσι
					ἀνδράσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					4.26
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰ. καὶ ὁμότιμοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.827b
				</span></i>
			: generally, <i>evenly balanced</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ἰσημερία ἐστὶ χειμὼν καὶ θέρος
					ἰσοκρατής</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					942b37
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰ. οἶνος</span>
			<i>half-and-half</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Morb.</u>
				2.42
			</span></i> (nisi leg. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰσοκραής</span>)
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">; ἐκ τῆς ἀμφοῖν -οῦς μίξεως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					6.528
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰ. κράσεις</span>
			<i>normal</i> temperaments, <i><span class="en">
				Ruf.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				8.24.61
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τῶς, ἀπομάχεσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.198
				</span></i>
			; <i>with even balance</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Zeno Stoic.
				1.27
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Iamb.
				<u>in Nic.</u>
				p.79
			</span></i> P.</div>
